OL,3,ASix tourists and pilot killed in Kenya
OL,4,Ahelicopter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix tourists and a pilot have been
OL,7,Fkilled after a helicopter crashed at
OL,8,FMount Ololokwe in central Kenya, air
OL,9,Faccident officials have told the BBC.
OL,11,FThe Aircraft Accident Investigation
OL,12,FDepartment said the nationalities of
OL,13,Fthe pilot and passengers were yet to be
OL,14,Fconfirmed.
OL,16,FThe Kenya Civil Aviation Authority
OL,17,F(KCAA) said the accident happened in
OL,18,FSamburu county at approximately 09:13
OL,19,Flocal time (06:13 GMT).
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
